    <title>19.女通讯录择偶标准|看酒品还是看学历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665c027a94977a26ef956058</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665c027a94977a26ef956058</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jun 2024 05:26:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>据说现在拉圈都卡学历，有个段子说现在打开rela仿佛打开了BOSS直聘，拉子们也太卷了，隔壁恋爱都在卷耐力只有我们还在卷学历。今天和六六浅聊一下女通讯录的择偶标准~酒品还是学历非要二选一的话哪个最重要呢？也欢迎大家一起讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指路】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>已经过了看学历的人生节点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>不太会喝酒，不知道对方到底有没有喝多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>假装喝醉也能撩妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大地跟初恋喝酒被吐身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想要实质性的进展的话，你喝的太多也不合适，所以这个分寸真的要靠自己来把握</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>高学历不解风情男令人下头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>嗯，所以对于女生的防备心没有那么强，而且进入亲密关系的话是会比较自然的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>也会遇到喝完酒发疯的妹子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2567">42:47</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>对，关于择偶的话，这个东西每个人考量不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>跟喜欢的女生约会，酒应该怎么喝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：大地 &nbsp;嘉宾：六六</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢小伙伴们的支持与陪伴，有想要参与节目可以添加节目微信【wenhebb】投稿分享，也可以加入我们的听友群和大家一起交流，听友群有不定期福利送出哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS:目前听友群暂时只对小姐姐开放哦，</span></p><span></span><p><span>想进群的友友们可加wenhebb进群</span></p>]]></description>
